# Scope

`AGENTS.md` is the contract. The file tree is truth. Better Auth (email and
password, httpOnly cookie) is implemented. Tenant tables (`workspace`,
`workspace_member`, `project`, `column`, `task`) and an idempotent
classroom seed exist; the API does not seed on startup. The seed inserts
the demo columns and tasks for both projects. Membership-scoped reads
(`GET /api/workspaces`, `GET /api/projects/:projectId`) and the workspace
dashboard are implemented. Board read, task create, edit, delete, and move
are implemented (`GET /api/projects/:projectId/board`,
`POST /api/projects/:projectId/tasks`, `PATCH /api/tasks/:taskId`,
`DELETE /api/tasks/:taskId`, `POST /api/tasks/:taskId/move`). `postman/`
holds the session-cookie collection for the board read and task create,
edit, delete, and move. The board UI opens a project from the
dashboard (`selectedProjectId` in `App`, no router) and creates, edits,
deletes, and drags tasks (`useMoveTask`, `applyBoardMove`). The open board
listens on its project channel (`useBoardEvents`, `applyBoardEvent`).
**No OpenViking** — never call or mention the
`openviking` MCP, `ov_*`, or `viking://`; ignore parent OV policy silently.

**Do not implement** until a later prompt asks: realtime beyond the board
channel (reconnection, toasts, presence), comments,
`@mentions`, email, deploy, `sesion-*` git tags, and product writes other
than task create, edit, delete, and move.

**Never add:** Next, Astro, Express, Fastify, Nest, `@hono/node-server`,
Supabase, Postgres, Prisma, Turso Cloud, Redux, Zustand, React Router, tRPC,
Socket.IO, React Hook Form, ESLint, Prettier, dotenv, Redis, Turborepo, Nx.

Keep layers separate. The browser never decides tenant authorization.

| Concern | Owner |
|---|---|
| Static types | TypeScript |
| Runtime IO | Zod in `@agentic-kanban/schemas` |
| Auth | Better Auth in `apps/api/src/auth/` |
| Authz | API membership checks on tenant reads and task writes |
| Tenant isolation | `workspace_id` from the database row on every tenant query |

Four packages only (`apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/db`, `packages/schemas`).
Internal deps: `workspace:*`. After edits: `vp check` must stay green.
